OL,3,GNEWSABasketball court renovated in
OL,4,Amemory of player
OL,5,
OL,6,FA basketball court dedicated to a
OL,7,Fplayer who died during a match is being
OL,8,Fopened following a renovation project.
OL,10,FThe Guillaume Memorial Court, also
OL,11,Fknown as The G Court, has been
OL,12,Fredeveloped at Millennium Park in St
OL,13,FHelier through a partnership between
OL,14,Fthe Government of Jersey and the Jersey
OL,15,FBasketball Association.
OL,17,FThe government said the court, which
OL,18,Fwill be officially opened at 10:00 BST,
OL,19,Fwould provide a "high quality community
OL,20,Ffacility" for the island while also
OL,21,Fserving as a lasting tribute to
OL,22,FGuillaume Hoareau.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
